    "other_problems_3qYHfE": {
      "type": "other-problems",
      "blocks": {
        "problem_FGBc8c": {
          "type": "problem",
          "settings": {
            "problem_heading": "<p>Trigger 1</p>",
            "problem_subheading": "<h3>Imbalanced Hormones</h3>",
            "problem_text": "<p>“High oestrogen hormone levels are linked to <strong>almost five times the risk of painful period cramps</strong> by increasing prostaglandin production.”</p><p>Source: Chan et al.(2023).</p>"
          }
        },
        "problem_Mqw8Wp": {
          "type": "problem",
          "settings": {
            "problem_heading": "<p>Trigger 2</p>",
            "problem_subheading": "<h3>Prostaglandins</h3>",
            "problem_text": "<p>“Women with painful cramps have over three times higher PGF2α (prostaglandin) levels, <strong>which strongly correlate with more intense contractions.”</strong></p><p>Source: Lundström & Green (1978).</p>"
          }
        },
        "problem_JWKbV4": {
          "type": "problem",
          "settings": {
            "problem_heading": "<p>Trigger 3</p>",
            "problem_subheading": "<h3>Micronutrient Gaps</h3>",
            "problem_text": "<p>“Deficiencies in key micronutrients, including magnesium, zinc, calcium, and vitamin D, are associated<strong> with increased severity of period pain.”</strong></p><p>Source: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis (PMC, 2020)</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "problem_FGBc8c",
        "problem_Mqw8Wp",
        "problem_JWKbV4"
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Other Problems",
      "settings": {
        "custom_class": "",
        "heading": "The Problem",
        "description": "<p>“Other women get to live their best lives – never missing work, fun, or exercise... <strong>Why do I have to suffer from painful cramps every single month?</strong>”</p>",
        "paragraph": "<p>The difference between a woman who barely notices her cramps and one who's sidelined by them often comes down to three interlinked triggers working together:</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Web_Image_-_Pain_1920x440_fe880a9c-d0e9-4eb4-a5e6-dd29112c8be0.png"
      }
    },
    "monthlies_solutions_ihetAM": {
      "type": "monthlies-solutions",
      "blocks": {
        "benefits_YTrfcX": {
          "type": "benefits",
          "settings": {
            "benefit_heading": "<h2><strong>1.</strong> Balance Your Hormones*</h2>",
            "benefit_subheading": "<h3>What happens?</h3>",
            "benefit_text": "<p>Your hormones naturally rise and fall each month. But when oestrogen rises too high (often under everyday stress, hectic schedules, bad sleep, or poor diet), it triggers an overproduction of prostaglandins - the main driver behind deeper cramps and inflammation.<br/><br/>The result? With this natural balance lost, you’re left facing heightened cramping, and fewer defenses against pain flares.</p>",
            "help-image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_512915.png",
            "help_heading": "<h3>How monthlies help</h3>",
            "help_subheading": "",
            "help_text": "<p>Formulated with scientifically backed ingredients like Lemon Balm, Broccoli Seed Extract, B-Complex, Myo-Inositol, Choline, and Flaxseed, monthlies supports hormonal balance at its core - optimising oestrogen metabolism, promoting healthy progesterone, and supporting stress management.*</p>",
            "help_text1": "<p>As your hormonal pathways are optimised you’re less prone to overactive cramping and inflammation from the start, setting the stage for cramps you barely even notice.*</p>",
            "read-more": "<p>Read More</p>",
            "read-less": "<p>Read Less</p>"
          }
        },
        "benefits_3LEDwR": {
          "type": "benefits",
          "settings": {
            "benefit_heading": "<h2><strong>2. </strong>Tame Prostaglandins*</h2>",
            "benefit_subheading": "<h3>What happens?</h3>",
            "benefit_text": "<p>Prostaglandins are essential and help your uterus shed it’s lining. However, when they surge - due to an overactive COX-2 enzyme - they directly intensify cramps, sharpen pain signals, and make them more frequent.<br/><br/>Painkillers work by blocking prostaglandins after they’ve spiked, often hitting COX-1 (needed for stomach protection) along with COX-2. This can lead to side effects like indigestion or ulcers - while leaving hormonal and nutrient imbalances unresolved, so the cycle of pain keeps repeating.</p>",
            "help-image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_512913.png",
            "help_heading": "<h3>How monthlies helps</h3>",
            "help_subheading": "",
            "help_text": "<p>Formulated with potent anti-inflammatory support from Ginger Root Extract, Turmeric, and Aniseed, monthlies helps combat inflammation - with Ginger and Turmeric selectively favouring COX-2 inhibition to safeguard your stomach lining.*</p><p></p>",
            "help_text1": "<p>And because monthlies is designed for daily use - unlike painkillers - it works to keep COX-2 in check all month long, helping manage discomfort during your period while also addressing pain before it even begins.*</p><p>By claiming pain amplifiers at their source, monthlies supports less intense contractions, lower inflammation, and helps ease the nerve sensitivity that magnifies cramps - without the side effects you can get from painkillers.*</p>",
            "read-more": "<p>Read More</p>",
            "read-less": "<p>Read Less</p>"
          }
        },
        "benefits_QGx474": {
          "type": "benefits",
          "settings": {
            "benefit_heading": "<h2><strong>3. </strong>Fill Micronutrient Gaps *</h2>",
            "benefit_subheading": "<h3>What happens?</h3>",
            "benefit_text": "<p>A woman’s body relies on micronutrients to manage cramps, energize muscles, and regulate inflammation. But monthly blood loss, combined with fast-paced living or less-than-ideal nutrition, can leave reserves depleted. <strong>A 2024 study let by  Harvard researchers found that many UK women have at least five major micronutrient gaps.*</strong></p>",
            "help-image": "shopify://shop_images/Group_512968.png",
            "help_heading": "<h3>How monthlies helps</h3>",
            "help_subheading": "",
            "help_text": "<p>Packed with 26 scientifically backed ingredients, monthlies is the UK’s most comprehensive formula for women’s health - all in a once-daily drink.</p>",
            "help_text1": "<p>By replenishing essential micronutrients like Magnesium, Zinc, Iron, the entire Vitamin B Complex, and Vitamins D3 + K2, monthlies helps strengthen muscle function, energy production, and hormonal balance.*</p><p>This results in better control over cramps, calmer inflammation, hormonal regulation, clearer skin, fewer mood swings, and overall more optimal, more comfortable cycles.*</p>",
            "read-more": "<p>Read More</p>",
            "read-less": "<p>Read Less</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "benefits_YTrfcX",
        "benefits_3LEDwR",
        "benefits_QGx474"
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Monthlies Solution",
      "settings": {
        "section-heading": "But here’s<strong> the good news!</strong>",
        "description": "<p>Leading specialists in menstrual health have found that <strong>by tackling all three underlying triggers at once, you can get ahead of cramps before they start -</strong> becoming the woman who barely notices them and doesn’t have to battle PMS or other monthly symptoms - thanks to a breakthrough approach.</p>",
        "Heading": "The Solution",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/unnamed_2.png",
        "paragraph": "<p>The first supplement designed to <strong>target the three biggest triggers behind period cramps</strong> - so you can actually function, work, and live your life without being sidelined.</p><p>Created by five female doctors and women’s health experts after personally helping over 2,500 women escape period pain at their clinics, monthlies brings together 26 of the most advanced natural compounds<strong> to help tackle the tri-factor of period cramps.*</strong></p>",
        "percentage_health": "<p>86%</p>",
        "improvement_text": "<p>saw improved cycle health after 30 days*</p>",
        "percentage_feeling": "<p>80%</p>",
        "feeling_text": "<p>reported feeling less period cramps and pain after 60 days*</p>",
        "note": "*Based on an independent study of 105 women aged 20 to 45 using the monthlies supplement.",
        "button": "<p>For references and/or sources, click <a href=\"#\">here</a>.</p>"
      }
    },
