        "reviews_7hXTgc": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "dsc": "<p>I honestly find it pretty shocking how much my cycle affects everyday life... During my period, I end up taking so many ibuprofen, which I know isn’t great.<br/><br/>I came across Monthlies and didn’t even know there was a natural alternative. Had to give it a try since it’s not only supposed to help with my pain, but also boost energy (which is great, especially since I do a lot of sports) and more 👀. I love that it's a brand run by women who really get it 🙏🏼.<br/><br/>I’ve been using the powder for about a week and a half, so I can’t give a full review yet (will update after the three months). But so far, the delivery was fast, the packaging is really nice and feels premium, and the taste is great. I actually look forward to my daily morning routine and I'm really curious to see how to goes :)</p>",
